## Description

The VRAM barrier is officially dead.  I just ran Qwen 3.8 Flash Next (MoE) 125B A6B with a  250,000 context window on a single 24GB RTX 4090.  21 tokens/sec decode. 364 t/s prefill.   no mtp. no dflash. no kv cache quantization!  We are running datacenter models on consumer https://t.co/v5tkPtZqDq

